msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Try to disable double buffering. This makes painting "
"more responsive, but might cause crashes with some ATI GPU/driver "
"combinations.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Intentar desactivar o uso de dobre búfer. Fai que o "
"programa reaccione mellor ao debuxar, pero podería facer que quebre con "
"certas combinacións de unidades GPU de ATI e controladores.</p></body></html>"

